  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Fill a medium saucepan three-quarters full with water and bring to the boil for the rice. Trim the spring onion, then cut the white part into 4cm lengths and thinly slice the green part. Cut the broccoli into 4cm lengths. Cut the capsicum into 1cm thick strips. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/138840/photos/large/prep_ingredients-06562611acfb1c186974dc085a9bc049.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook rice: Cook the rice in the pan of boiling water for 25 mins or until tender. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/138841/photos/large/cook_rice-d4a20140405a8404bace1bfcf134eabe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Soften veggies: Meanwhile, heat 1 tbs vegetable oil in a medium saucepan over medium-high heat. Cook the capsicum, garlic and white part of the spring onion, stirring, for 2-3 mins until starting to soften. Add the tofu and turn to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/138842/photos/large/soften_veggies-99c885c6b6a006cc9a9032f090e8f6a6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer braise: Add 2 tbs soy sauce, 2 tsp honey and 125ml (½ cup) water to the pan. Reduce the heat to medium and cook, covered, for 3 mins. Add the broccoli and cook for a further 2 mins or until the capsicum is tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/138843/photos/large/simmer_braise-b8fe957d898cfc65a4b8d99f23393c96.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the rice among bowls and top with the tofu braise. Scatter over the sesame seeds and remaining spring onion and enjoy.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/138844/photos/large/serve_up-45ca3b706b57172dbc95bccac1386bd2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Add some sliced fresh chilli to serve for an extra flavour kick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/138845/photos/large/make_it_yours-8ffa66dd3f4759ea978d521de9ee2114.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
